      "title": "Pennsylvania mandates format-matched disclosure labels on AI-generated ads",
      "summary": "Pennsylvania Governor Josh Shapiro signed the Artificial Intelligence Deceptive Advertising Act, requiring disclosure labels on AI-generated ads. Any advertising across text, audio, images, or video significantly modified by AI must display disclosures matching the ad's native format.",
      "key_facts": [
        "Governor Josh Shapiro signed the Artificial Intelligence Deceptive Advertising Act.",
        "Mandates disclosures for ads significantly modified or generated by AI.",
        "Requires labels in the same format as text, audio, or video."
      ],
      "design_implication": "In an ad platform design system, compliance disclaimers can no longer sit hidden in footer links or tiny fine print. Because labels must mirror the ad's own medium, designers must create responsive overlay badges for video, spoken tags for audio streams, and inline microcopy for static cards. Audit existing sponsored media components and build a reusable set of format-matched disclosure tokens.",
      "implication_lens": "trust_and_risk",
      "visual_need": "illustrate",
      "source_name": "The Verge (AI)",
      "source_url": "https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018187/pennsylvania-ai-deceptive-advertising-act",
      "source_date": "2026-10-24",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "claim": "Pennsylvania signed into law requirements for disclosures on AI-generated ads.",
          "quote": "On Thursday, Pennsylvania Governor Josh Shapiro signed the Artificial Intelligence Deceptive Advertising Act into law, requiring disclosures on AI-generated ads."
        },
        {
          "claim": "Labels must match the format of the ad across text, audio, images, and video.",
          "quote": "The law requires any ad - whether it's a still image, video, audio, or text - that \"has been significantly modified or generated by artificial intelligence\" to include a label in the same format as the ad itself."
        }
      ],
